// The player: a red-haired adventurer in a vest over a blue shirt, drawn
// on the humanoid rig (parts put together into poses; crates/art) in a
// three-quarter view: the near arm hangs at the back of the body, the far
// arm peeks out in front of it, the near leg in front. Facing right; the
// game mirrors it. (The old green-tunic adventurer: player_classic.ron.)
